  "Import your Lightroom Classic catalog to keep folders, ratings, flags, labels, keywords and edits. Your .lrcat is only read, and photos stay where they are.": "导入 Lightroom Classic 图库，保留文件夹、评分、旗标、标签、关键词和编辑。只读取 .lrcat 文件，照片保留在原位置。",
  "Import Lightroom catalog…": "导入 Lightroom 图库…", "Import Lightroom Catalog…": "导入 Lightroom 图库…", "New empty catalog…": "新建空图库…", "Open catalog…": "打开图库…", "New catalog…": "新建图库…", "Add photo folder…": "添加照片文件夹…", "Catalog: open, create or import": "图库：打开、新建或导入", "Camera profiles": "相机配置文件", "Lens profiles": "镜头配置文件", "Presets": "预设", "Yours": "你的文件", "Good to know": "使用须知", "Start": "开始使用", "Skip for now": "暂时跳过", "Choose a catalog first": "请先选择图库", "Reopen it any time from the catalog menu › Setup assistant": "可随时从图库菜单 › 设置向导重新打开",
  "Profiles set the starting look, such as Adobe Color. Choose a folder and RAWmakase imports the .dcp profiles and .xmp looks in it and its subfolders.": "配置文件决定初始色彩，例如 Adobe Color。选择文件夹后，MyAIRAW 会导入其中及子文件夹内的 .dcp 配置和 .xmp 风格。",
  "Lens profiles correct distortion and vignetting, like Lightroom's Enable Profile Corrections. Choose a folder and RAWmakase imports the .lcp profiles in it and its subfolders.": "镜头配置文件可校正畸变和暗角，相当于 Lightroom 的启用配置文件校正。选择文件夹后，MyAIRAW 会导入其中及子文件夹内的 .lcp 文件。",
  "Your Lightroom develop presets are .xmp files. Choose a folder and RAWmakase imports the presets in it and its subfolders, keeping their groups. Presets that need something RAWmakase lacks still appear and apply what they can.": "Lightroom 显影预设为 .xmp 文件。选择文件夹后，MyAIRAW 会导入其中及子文件夹内的预设并保留分组；部分不支持的设置会保留记录，支持的部分仍可应用。",
  "AI and color-range masks aren't rendered yet; they stay in the catalog.": "部分 AI 和颜色范围蒙版尚不支持渲染，但会保留在图库中。", "Export presets, watermarks and plug-ins don't carry over.": "Lightroom 的导出预设、水印和插件不会一同导入。", "Calibrated display? Set it in Develop under Settings › Monitor Profile.": "已校准显示器？请在偏好设置 › 显示中选择显示器 ICC 配置文件。",
  "Looking for profiles for your cameras…": "正在查找相机配置文件…", "Looking for lens profiles for your cameras…": "正在查找镜头配置文件…", "Choose a catalog to find lens profiles for your cameras.": "请选择图库，以便查找对应相机的镜头配置。", "Choose folder…": "选择文件夹…", "Choose files…": "选择文件…", "Imports every file in the folder and its subfolders": "导入文件夹及全部子文件夹中的文件", "Import {} profiles": "导入 {} 个配置文件", "Import {lenses} lens profiles": "导入 {lenses} 个镜头配置", "Import {found} presets": "导入 {found} 个预设", "{presets} presets already in RAWmakase.": "MyAIRAW 中已有 {presets} 个预设。", "No profiles found for {cameras}.": "未找到适用于 {cameras} 的配置文件。", "No lens profiles found for {makers}.": "未找到适用于 {makers} 的镜头配置。", "Found {adobe} Adobe and {user_profiles} of your profiles for {cameras}": "已找到适用于 {cameras} 的 {adobe} 个 Adobe 配置和 {user_profiles} 个用户配置", "Found {lenses} lens profiles for {makers} and third-party lenses": "找到 {lenses} 个适用于 {makers} 及第三方镜头的配置", "Found {user_profiles} of your profiles. Choose a catalog to also find Adobe's profiles and narrow yours to your cameras.": "找到 {user_profiles} 个用户配置。选择图库后，还可查找 Adobe 配置并筛选对应相机。",
  "Lightroom keeps them in CameraRaw/CameraProfiles, under /Library/Application Support/Adobe on a Mac and C:\\\\ProgramData\\\\Adobe on Windows. Copy that folder here, or any folder of profiles.": "Lightroom 将其保存在 CameraRaw/CameraProfiles 中，Mac 上位于 /Library/Application Support/Adobe。可选择该文件夹或其他包含配置文件的文件夹。",
  "Lightroom keeps them in CameraRaw/LensProfiles. Adobe's cover thousands of lenses; the folders of your camera maker and lens brands are enough.": "Lightroom 将其保存在 CameraRaw/LensProfiles 中。Adobe 提供数千种镜头配置，只需选择你的相机或镜头品牌文件夹。",
