  "Drag to adjust · double-click to reset. Drag or type the number for precise edits.": "拖动调整 · 双击重置。拖动数值或直接输入可精细调整。", "Turn {title} off": "关闭{title}", "Turn {title} on": "启用{title}", "Reset {title}": "重置{title}", "Click to add · drag to shape · right-click to remove": "点击添加 · 拖动调整形状 · 右键移除", "Finish cropping · Enter or R": "完成裁剪 · Enter 或 R", "Drag the frame on the photo; changes apply live.": "拖动照片上的裁剪框，修改实时生效。", "Swap portrait and landscape · X": "交换横竖方向 · X", "Drag along a horizon or vertical to level it · or Cmd-drag on the photo": "沿水平或垂直线拖动拉直 · 也可在照片上 Cmd 拖动", "O cycles the overlays, Shift+O turns them": "O 切换参考线，Shift+O 旋转", "When the overlay shows: always, with the pointer over the photo, or never": "叠加显示时机：始终、指针在照片上或从不", "Remove the crop, straightening, rotation and flips": "移除裁剪、拉直、旋转与翻转", "Shrink the crop, keeping its aspect, to leave out the white areas outside the photo": "保持比例缩小裁剪，排除照片外的白色区域", "Show highlight clipping · J shows both": "显示高光剪裁 · J 同时显示阴影", "Show shadow clipping · J shows both": "显示阴影剪裁 · J 同时显示高光", "White balance selector (W): click a neutral area of the photo": "白平衡吸管（W）：点击照片中的中性区域", "Set the tone sliders automatically · {shortcut}": "自动设置色调滑块 · {shortcut}", "Make the photo's near-neutral areas neutral": "将照片中接近中性的区域调整为中性", "The Auto mix is applied": "已应用自动混合", "Set the mix from the photo's colors": "根据照片颜色设置混合", "This profile has no Amount": "此配置不支持强度调整", "Draw up to four guides along verticals and horizontals · Shift+T": "沿垂直及水平线绘制最多四条引导线 · Shift+T", "Magnify the photo while placing a guide's end": "放置引导线端点时放大照片", "Analyse the photo again, e.g. after changing lens corrections": "重新分析照片，例如更改镜头校正后", "Import every DCP profile and XMP look in a folder and its subfolders": "导入文件夹及子文件夹内全部 DCP 配置和 XMP 风格", "Import every .lcp lens profile in a folder and its subfolders": "导入文件夹及子文件夹内全部 .lcp 镜头配置", "Save the RGB, Red, Green and Blue curves under a name": "命名保存 RGB、红、绿、蓝曲线", "Saves the RGB, Red, Green and Blue curves for the Point Curve menu.