  " and a box": "和一个选框", "Click on the photo to add to this selection, Alt-click to leave something out": "点击照片添加选区，按住 Alt 点击排除区域", "Find it again and replace only this part of the mask; its other parts and the adjustments stay": "重新选择并替换此蒙版部分，其他部分与调整保持不变", "The download stopped: {why}. Download again to carry on from where it stopped.": "下载已停止：{why}。重新下载即可从断点继续。", "This copy of RAWmakase has no ONNX Runtime library, so selecting cannot run yet.": "此 MyAIRAW 缺少 ONNX Runtime 库，暂时无法运行智能选择。", "Masks made from a selection are stored in the catalog, which needs a newer format. RAWmakase first saves a backup copy beside the catalog (as large as it), then upgrades it. Older versions of RAWmakase cannot open an upgraded catalog, and it must not be open on another computer or in another copy of RAWmakase.": "智能选区蒙版需要新版图库格式。MyAIRAW 会先在图库旁保存同等大小的备份，再升级图库。旧版程序无法打开升级后的图库；升级时请勿在其他电脑或程序中同时打开该图库。",
  "Adds Adobe Standard and the Camera Matching profiles from Lightroom's installation ({} files), which Adobe Color and the other Adobe looks build on.": "从 Lightroom 安装目录添加 Adobe Standard 和相机匹配配置（{} 个文件），为 Adobe Color 等风格提供基础。", "Apply the camera's reference exposure offset while leaving the Exposure slider unchanged.": "应用相机参考曝光偏移，不改变曝光滑块。", "Fitted to Camera Raw on synthetic eyes. Corrections are saved apart from the rest of the edit, so older RAWmakase releases open the photo without them.": "通过模拟眼睛拟合 Camera Raw 红眼校正。校正独立保存，旧版程序打开照片时不会应用此校正。", "Not yet measured against Lightroom. Spots and masks are saved apart from the rest of the edit, so older RAWmakase releases open the photo without them.": "尚未与 Lightroom 对比验证。修复点和蒙版独立保存，旧版程序打开照片时不会应用它们。", "Fringe color selector: click a purple or green fringe in the photo": "去边颜色吸管：点击照片中的紫色或绿色边缘", "Import Adobe .lcp lens profiles, e.g. from /Library/Application Support/Adobe/CameraRaw/LensProfiles": "导入 Adobe .lcp 镜头配置，例如 /Library/Application Support/Adobe/CameraRaw/LensProfiles", "Import DCP camera profiles and XMP look profiles. Select the matching base DCP and XMP together.": "导入 DCP 相机配置与 XMP 风格，请同时选择匹配的基础 DCP 和 XMP。", "Imported {} Adobe profiles for {} {}. Choose one from the Profile menu.": "已为 {} 个 Adobe 配置导入 {} {} 的配置，请从配置文件菜单中选择。", "Level the photo as Upright's Level would, by its angle alone": "仅按倾斜角度拉平照片，相当于 Upright 水平校正", "Natural cubic curves, hue-preserving master processing and an sRGB transfer in ProPhoto RGB. Older edits keep their saved curve behavior until enabled.": "自然三次曲线、保色相主曲线处理及 ProPhoto RGB 中的 sRGB 转换。启用前，旧编辑保留已保存的曲线行为。", "Neutral-preserving primary adjustments and corrected shadow tint. Older edits keep their saved behavior until enabled.": "保留中性色的原色调整与改进的阴影色调。启用前，旧编辑保留原有行为。", "Render with the current process, including built-in lens corrections": "使用当前处理版本渲染，包括内置镜头校正", "Updated vibrance, color mixer luminance and RGB-hue split toning. Older saved edits retain their original rendering until enabled.": "改进自然饱和度、颜色混合器明亮度及 RGB 色相分离色调。启用前，旧编辑保留原有渲染。", "Use the camera profile's base tone curve. Older edits retain their original rendering until enabled.": "使用相机配置的基础色调曲线。启用前，旧编辑保留原有渲染。", "Targeted adjustment: drag up or down on the photo to brighten or darken its color · {}": "目标调整：在照片上上下拖动，改变该颜色的明暗 · {}", "Targeted adjustment: drag up or down on the photo to change its color's {name} · {}": "目标调整：在照片上上下拖动，改变该颜色的{name} · {}", "Targeted adjustment: drag up or down on the photo to move the region of the tone curve there · {}": "目标调整：在照片上上下拖动，调整对应区域的色调曲线 · {}", "{steps} in Calibration to use Point Color.": "请在校准中{steps}，以使用点颜色。", "{work} This can take a few minutes for a large catalog.": "{work} 大型图库可能需要几分钟。", "{} won't be exported: {reasons}": "{} 不会导出：{reasons}", "{}\\n\\nDo you wish to overwrite the existing files, skip the existing files, or rename the exported files to avoid collision?": "{}\\n\\n覆盖已有文件、跳过已有文件，还是重命名导出文件以避免冲突？"
